:MinVehicleImpedance a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Minimum Vehicle Impedance"@en ;
    :shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/MinVehicleImpedanceShape> ;
    dcterms:created "2024-05-30"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:source <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/1695/oj> ;
    rdfs:comment """Impedance as defined in the TSI CCS (Annex I, Appendix A, Table A.2 -Index 77).

Minimum vehicle impedance (between wheels and pantograph) (only for vehicles equipped for 1500V or 3000V DC).

Per Voltage:
[1500]: [CCCC]+[ZZZZ], with input capacitance [CCCC](Cin) and input impedance [ZZZZ](Zin)
[3000]: [CCCC]+[ZZZZ], idem."""@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy : ;
    rdfs:seeAlso "https://www.era.europa.eu/system/files/2023-09/index077_-_ERA_ERTMS_033281_v5.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote "The MinVehicleImpedance class is applicable for track circuits."@en .

:nationalLine a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "national line identification"@en ;
    :XMLName "SOLLineIdentification" ;
    :rinfIndex "1.1.0.0.0.2" ;
    :shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/NationalLineSoL> ;
    dcterms:created "2024-05-24"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2024-10-24"^^xsd:date,
        "2024-11-18"^^xsd:date,
        "2024-11-29"^^xsd:date,
        "2025-02-18"^^xsd:date,
        "2025-03-11"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:replaces :lineNationalId,
        :lineReference ;
    rdfs:comment """Indicates a relationship with a national railway line at a specific kilometer point.
For a Section of Line: unique line identification or unique line number within Member State."""@en ;
    rdfs:domain :SectionOfLine ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy : ;
    rdfs:range :LinearPositioningSystem ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :solGenericObjParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Each SoL can belong to only one national line.

In case when SoL is the track connecting between OPs within big node (resulting from division of big station into several smaller) the line can be identified using the name of this track."""@en .

